<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps Selected Utilities sets div.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps Selected Utilities sets div.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Selected Utilities Income Inc, a closed-end investment company, said it has declared a regular unchanged $0.06 a share dividend on its common stock payable February 10, March 10 and April 10.</p>
<p>The corresponding record dates are February 4, February 28 and March 31.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
